<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>레스토랑 예약 시스템</title>
</head>
<body>
	<form th:action="@{/restaurant/bookingComplete}" method="POST">
		<h2>레스토랑 예약하기</h2>
		<label for = "movieTitle">영화 제목</label>
		<input type="text" name="movieTitle" placeholder="영화제목 입력"/>
		<br>
		<label for = "reserveDate">관람 날짜</label>
		<input type="date" name="reserveDate" placeholder="관람 날짜입력"/>
		<br>
		<label for = "reserveTime">관람 시간</label>
		<input type="time" name="reserveTime" placeholder="관람 시간 입력"/>
		<br>
		<label for = "people">인원수</label>
		<input type="text" name="people" placeholder="인원수 입력"/>
		<br>
		<label for = "reserverName">예매자 성함</label>
		<input type="text" name="reserverName" placeholder="예매자 성함 입력"/>
		<br>
		<input type="submit" name="submit" value="예매하기"/>
	</form>
</body>
</html>